1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,120
 When we arrived at her home and began reviewing the lessons,

2
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:07,860
 we came once again to allow typing.

3
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:12,200
 She said to us, "Last night, I knelt in prayer

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:15,840
 and told a Heavenly Father that I truly wanted

5
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:18,280
 to become a member of his church,

6
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:21,760
 and that he would need to help me leave this law.

7
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:25,600
 As we heard those words, a profound feeling of peace

8
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:29,680
 and assurance fills our minds and heart.

9
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:34,100
 We knew that the Lord had both her prayers and ours.

10
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:37,000
 She was baptized a following Saturday.

11
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,800
 A few weeks later, I was transferred to another area,

12
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:43,840
 but I remained in contact with her bishop.

13
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:47,200
 He told me she arrived every week

14
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,120
 with her titan envelope.

15
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:52,480
 And then on the first Sunday of every month,

16
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:55,520
 she also brought her fast offering.

17
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:59,000
 Throughout my life, I have learned to trust in the Lord.

18
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,000
 I have seen in numerous years.

